step Dalson's Tears farmhouse
  tip The diary lies in the farmhouse, the cabinet stands inside and the outhouse is behind it. A Wandering Skeleton carries the outhouse key; Farmer Dalson comes out when you open the outhouse and carries the cabinet key.
  accept 5058 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Mrs. Dalson's Diary, inside
  turnin 5058 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead
  accept 5060                         -- Locked Cabinet, inside
  collect 12739 quest 5060 @48.1,49.7 -- Farmer Dalson
  turnin 5060

step Sorrow Hill
  tip Argent Officer Pureheart stands at the south end of the Sorrow Hill graveyard, where the road from Tarren Mill comes in; Marlene's house stands by the road, and Joseph Redpath's monument is in the graveyard behind it.
  accept 5142 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Upstairs
  note Keep Little Pamela: Pamela is in Darrowshire, visited again later.

step Mulgris Deepriver
  tip He camps by the Writhing Haunt, south-east of Dalson's Tears.
  accept 4984 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Inside

