# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Eastern Plaguelands

step Augustus the Touched
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Follow the road east through the Western Plaguelands and across the river into the Eastern Plaguelands; leave it north for Terrordale, the ruined town in the north-west. Augustus sits in a hut at its edge.
  accept 6164 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Inside; walks around Terrordale: the map marks where to look

step Terrordale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  collect 15884 quest 6164 @17.4,31.1 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Upstairs

step Terrordale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip The book lies in the ruined inn of Terrordale; the undead in the town are 54-56, so pull them one at a time.
  tip The Large Termite Mounds stand all over the hills east of Terrordale. Use the Empty Termite Jar on each mound you pass.
  collect 12840 quest 5408 optional only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Minion's Scourgestones: the Terrordale undead drop them while you wear the Argent Dawn Commission
  note Keep Augustus' Receipt Book: Augustus takes it back on the Eastern Plaguelands guide's Terrordale stop.

