step Through Timbermaw Hold
  zone Winterspring
  tip Walk into the Timbermaw Hold tunnel beside Nafien and never attack the Timbermaw furbolgs inside. Salfa stands at the tunnel's Winterspring exit; then follow the road east to Everlook, the goblin town where the next guide starts.
  turnin 8465 only Orc,Tauren,Troll,Undead -- Salfa

